Phase 2: Standalone predictive value

Create 02_signal_predictiveness.py.

Construct:

[
y_{i,t,k}=r_{i,t+k},\qquad k=1,\ldots,20
]

and compounded forward returns:

[
R_{i,t}^{(h)}
=\prod_{j=1}^{h}(1+r_{i,t+j})-1,
\qquad h\in{1,2,5,10,20}.
]

